  "title": "· CELINE New Luggage Small Handbag ·",
  "original_title": "CELINE New Luggage 小号手袋",
  "excerpt": "CELINE reimagines its 2010 Phantom Luggage as a compact horizontal handbag in soft lambskin leather for Spring 2026.",
  "author": "撰稿 X Vivi 编辑 X RAN",
  "date_iso": "2026-02-03",
  "date_label": "February 03, 2026",
  "cover_image": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/8liunqx/4d3d54ab61593a18.jpg",
