    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CELINE’s Spring 2026 collection introduces the new**New Luggage**handbag, a reimagining of the 2010**Phantom Luggage**smiley bag with a fresh horizontal silhouette and soft lambskin leather. Its compact, dainty shape pairs with the iconic zip pocket for an elegant yet effortless look.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
