      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/8liunqx/7b12ad42fea7ab2f.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Design Inspiration ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/8liunqx/068a20dbb6ed4bce.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/8liunqx/6374d4a1d93ad92a.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The**Phantom Luggage**was designed by Phoebe Philo in 2010, its distinctive wave-like lines inspired by the**Mistral**bag created by founder Céline Vipiana in 1969. The new**New Luggage**is the first handbag by current creative director**Michael Rider**, debuted on the Spring 2026 runway, reinterpreting a house archive piece through a modern lens.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/8liunqx/cfab60e6664f9550.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/8liunqx/9a96af6302fdacb6.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "caption",
      "text": "Phantom Luggage handbag",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Michael Rider spent a decade at Old Céline under Phoebe Philo as ready-to-wear design director. He then served as creative director of Polo Ralph Lauren from 2018, left in late May 2024, and succeeded Hedi Slimane as CELINE’s new creative director in 2025.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Michael Rider | Fashion Designer | Nationality: American | Education: Brown University | Former: Céline Ready-to-Wear Design Director (2008–2018), Polo Ralph Lauren Creative Director (2018–2024) | Current: CELINE Creative Director (2025–present)",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "“Clothing can extend life, becoming part of the wearer’s story. It freezes a moment while also narrating years of gestures, occasions, and changes—past, present, and future, memory, utility, and fantasy. It is life itself.”",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "His debut collection blends Phoebe Philo’s minimalist aesthetic, Hedi Slimane’s rock edge, and Michael Rider’s own American preppy style. Dramatic rings, necklaces, and brooches draw from the**Bourgeois**style championed by founder Céline Vipiana, injecting vitality into the lineup.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
