    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The biggest difference between the**New Luggage**and the original smiley bag is its widened East-West shape and use of lightweight leather. The bag becomes soft and airy, shifting from a sharp, professional OL style to a relaxed, French nonchalance—as if ready to sit down at a sidewalk café and pull out a book for a leisurely pause.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
