    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The bag’s angular, “square-face” structure is replaced by soft, flowing piped edges. The signature wave-like lines on the sides evolve from three-dimensional convex forms to a single, flat seam. The horizontal silhouette and casually dangling zipper give a very relaxed, comfortable look.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Zoom in for an ultra-clear visual experience.",
      "url": null,
