    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The top features a**zipper closure**under a short flap—like a smiley with bangs—adorable and more secure. The combination of light tan leather and gold hardware is classic and timeless, perfect for both daily commutes and casual outfits. Metal feet allow the bag to stand upright steadily and protect the bottom from wear.",
